{"id":"n83378c1650","headline":"Congress Opposes Decision to Charge Fees on UPI, Demands It Stay Free","summary":"Congress condemned a central government decision that opens the way for charges on UPI merchant payments above ₹2,000. The party demands that UPI remain free.","why":"UPI is India's dominant real-time payments network, and any merchant fees would affect payment companies, banks and retailers.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"tarunmitra.in","url":"https://www.tarunmitra.in/national/demand-to-keep-congresss-protest-free-on-the-decision-to/article-163109"},"sources":[{"name":"tarunmitra.in","url":"https://www.tarunmitra.in/national/demand-to-keep-congresss-protest-free-on-the-decision-to/article-163109"}],"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:23:20Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-14T15:27:42Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"68948e7fa9e0ea8b","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-14T15:27:42Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-16T11:23:20Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-16T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"UPI पर शुल्क लगाने के फैसले पर कांग्रेस का विरोध, फ्री रखने की मांग","source_language":"hin","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/smartphone-5537230.jpg","alt":"smartphone (illustration)","credit":"tranmautritam","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/iphone-hand-phone-mobile-phone-5537230/"}}